// MUGGING_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1329714695" "Give it up."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4189861273" "Trust me. You don't want to resist."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3209099187" "You'd be wise to give up."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1012260042" "Don't make me angry."

// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3466386450" "Keep back, hero!"
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3867852619" "You'll be sorry you messed with me."
// MUGGING_MUGGER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3677690063" "I'm going to put you in the ground."

// MUGGING_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1718976958" "Please! Just leave me alone!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P558483644" "I don't want any trouble!"
// MUGGING_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2490893211" "Go away! Please, just go away!"

// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P932037145" "You're so brave."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P1806200587" "I don't know how I can thank you."
// MUGGING_VICTIM_THANKYOU_TEXT :
"P3005253364" "It's people like you who give me hope for this city."

