// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P616682310" "The lines are clear.  They step over them.  We squash them."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3030486027" "No one interferes with our business in Faultline."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P785378381" "We'll make some good profit on these base items."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
