// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2247174325" "Arachnos?  I've got nothing to say about them.  Except, I did their flyer."
// FAULTLINE_DAM_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
